   "seed": 217732815,
   "text": "MIRRORING RULE SET \u2014 applies to every screen in the system when tenants.default_language_id is Dari (fa) or Pashto (ps):\n   1. Sidebar moves to the right edge \u00b7 2. Drawers open from the LEFT \u00b7 3. Text and table columns right-align, and column ORDER reverses\n   4. Back arrows, chevrons and progress steppers mirror \u00b7 5. Numbers, SKUs, barcodes, currency amounts and dates keep reading left-to-right\n   6. Icons keep their meaning but directional ones (\u2190 \u2192) flip. Direction is a tenant setting only \u2014 there is no per-user or per-page switcher.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "MIRRORING RULE SET \u2014 applies to every screen in the system when tenants.default_language_id is Dari (fa) or Pashto (ps):\n   1. Sidebar moves to the right edge \u00b7 2. Drawers open from the LEFT \u00b7 3. Text and table columns right-align, and column ORDER reverses\n   4. Back arrows, chevrons and progress steppers mirror \u00b7 5. Numbers, SKUs, barcodes, currency amounts and dates keep reading left-to-right\n   6. Icons keep their meaning but directional ones (\u2190 \u2192) flip. Direction is a tenant setting only \u2014 there is no per-user or per-page switcher.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
